{"municipality_code":"14118","pref":"神奈川県","city":"横浜市都筑区","headline":"街道の街の雰囲気が感じられ、村の境界の痕跡も見つかるかもしれません。","display_comment_enriched":"横浜市都筑区には、地域の歴史や暮らしを伝える案内板や石碑があり、それらを手がかりに街歩きを楽しめます。 周辺には史跡や遺跡、古墳や貝塚、寺社や信仰の場にまつわる場所が点在し、「茅ヶ崎城跡」、「神隠丸山遺跡」、「歳勝土遺跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 川沿いや水辺では、暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を伝える案内板、治水碑、河川改修の記念碑にも注目してみてください。 「茅ヶ崎城址公園」や「茅ヶ崎城跡」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":116,"rank":583,"percentile":69.0,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":95,"rank":224,"percentile":88.1,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":11,"rank":1583,"percentile":14.4,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":12,"rank":673,"percentile":60.4,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":3,"rank":1013,"percentile":37.8,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":13,"rank":329,"percentile":80.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":1,"rank":574,"percentile":56.3,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":13,"rank":1029,"percentile":44.1,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_people":[],"tourism_landmarks":["茅ヶ崎城址